WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,320 --> 00:00:03,840
Zhang Jianguo, what are you doing?

2
00:00:05,870 --> 00:00:07,630
I want to go to sea and try it. Are you crazy?

3
00:00:07,630 --> 00:00:09,430
The old captain said that we can't go to sea today

4
00:00:09,430 --> 00:00:10,630
Didn’t the old boat head say that?

5
00:00:10,870 --> 00:00:12,030
The typhoon will take half a day to arrive

6
00:00:12,030 --> 00:00:15,520
As long as I come back before the typhoon lands, you'll be fine

7
00:00:15,960 --> 00:00:19,220
Dad has struggled all his life

8
00:00:19,620 --> 00:00:21,820
My greatest pride is building a house and a yard

9
00:00:21,820 --> 00:00:23,020
Buy this boat

10
00:00:23,020 --> 00:00:24,820
Married me three more wives in succession

11
00:00:24,820 --> 00:00:26,460
It’s just that the house is already dilapidated

12
00:00:26,460 --> 00:00:28,140
I didn’t keep my three wives either.

13
00:00:28,340 --> 00:00:30,740
Now I have to borrow my father's burden

14
00:00:30,740 --> 00:00:31,980
By this boat

15
00:00:32,100 --> 00:00:34,140
Create a happy life for the family

16
00:00:36,090 --> 00:00:37,530
Zhang Jianguo, you are crazy

17
00:00:37,530 --> 00:00:39,490
The bones that are usually lazy are getting tired

18
00:00:39,490 --> 00:00:41,570
There's going to be a typhoon this time, so why are you pretending to be sentimental?

19
00:00:41,570 --> 00:00:43,850
Lao Chuantou is a highly respected elder in the village.

20
00:00:43,850 --> 00:00:46,160
In my previous life, I could go to sea on an ocean-going ship

21
00:00:46,160 --> 00:00:48,240
Or is it the bridge he built for the debt he owes?

22
00:00:48,240 --> 00:00:50,800
Master Qi, they all say that the bigger the wave is, the more expensive it is.

23
00:00:50,800 --> 00:00:52,840
I want to try fooling around

24
00:00:52,840 --> 00:00:54,320
You have never been to the sea

25
00:00:55,290 --> 00:00:57,490
I just walk around nearby and don’t go far

26
00:00:57,490 --> 00:00:58,530
If you see something is wrong

27
00:00:58,530 --> 00:00:59,530
I'll be right back

28
00:00:59,530 --> 00:01:14,360
You kid is dying

29
00:01:14,360 --> 00:01:18,190
I don’t know if Jianguo will be in danger, right?

30
00:01:18,590 --> 00:01:20,750
Then if something happens to him at sea

31
00:01:20,750 --> 00:01:22,340
You have to prove it to me

32
00:01:22,340 --> 00:01:23,380
It’s not that I don’t want to persuade

33
00:01:23,380 --> 00:01:25,060
This kid never listens to me

34
00:01:25,060 --> 00:01:26,660
It's useless what I say

35
00:01:26,660 --> 00:01:27,980
The dock just existed

36
00:01:27,980 --> 00:01:29,300
Lao Chuantou and Chen Laosan

37
00:01:29,300 --> 00:01:31,180
Or read enough to point out Zhang Jianguo’s departure to the sea?

38
00:01:31,180 --> 00:01:33,420
My dear second uncle keeps going to Chugugun

39
00:01:33,420 --> 00:01:35,260
As long as Zhang Jianguo really dies at sea

40
00:01:35,260 --> 00:01:36,420
Someone is talking about this

41
00:01:36,420 --> 00:01:37,420
Will it affect my stay in the Imperial Army?

42
00:01:37,420 --> 00:01:41,270
Inheriting the property from your eldest brother's family means you will be destitute.

43
00:01:41,270 --> 00:01:43,510
Fourth uncle, what are you looking at me for?

44
00:01:43,510 --> 00:01:45,750
People are doing it, God is watching

45
00:01:45,750 --> 00:01:47,990
Tiezhu, people can’t be too selfish

46
00:01:47,990 --> 00:01:48,990
Too selfish

47
00:01:49,030 --> 00:01:50,750
The Dragon King will not bless you either

48
00:01:50,750 --> 00:01:52,390
Fourth uncle, that's not what I meant

49
00:01:52,390 --> 00:01:58,240
It would be better to die
